################################################################################
### How to Use This Software   ###
################################################################################
1 - Copy-Paste the link-url from your playlist or video/audio that you want to download
2 - Select the right settings in the menu at the left-top of the app
3 - Click on the massive button at the bottom 
4 - There you go !

This software is based on YT-DLP. It's more like an UI interface for it that a unic tool
Enjoy ! :3
(if you have some issues with the software, send me an e-mail with the description of the issue
